        "content": "## New tweets\n\n**Purpose**: n8n workflow: New tweets. 8 nodes wired together. Uses: manualTrigger, twitter, airtable, stopAndError. Sourced from czlonkowski/Zie619 n8n-workflows community archive (workflows/Manual/0005_Manual_Twitter_Create_Triggered.json). Configure credentials and any hardcoded IDs before activating.\n\n**Services needed**: manualTrigger, twitter, airtable, stopAndError\n\n**Difficulty**: 5min-config\n\n**Setup**:\n1. Configure credentials for the services above\n2. Update any hardcoded IDs / URLs\n3. Test with sample data before activating\n\n_Source: https://github.com/Zie619/n8n-workflows_\n_Curated by ai-ops-architect on 2026-05-05_",
        "height": 480,
        "width": 480
      },
